n\u0000Agent-host-level MCP servers exposed to every session, keyed by server name. Each value is a server configuration (see `<serverName>`).":"서버 이름을 키로 사용하여 모든 세션에 노출되고 에이전트 호스트 수준의 MCP 서버입니다. 각 값은 서버 구성입니다(`<serverName>` 참조).","agentHost.config.mcpServers.entry.description\u0000A single MCP server entry. The property key is the server name.":"단일 MCP 서버 항목입니다. 속성 키는 서버 이름입니다.","agentHost.config.mcpServers.entry.title\u0000MCP Server":"MCP 서버","agentHost.config.mcpServers.env.description\u0000For `stdio` servers, environment variables set on the spawned process.":"`stdio` 서버의 경우 생성된 프로세스에 설정되는 환경 변수입니다.","agentHost.config.mcpServers.env.title\u0000Environment":"환경","agentHost.config.mcpServers.headers.description\u0000For `http` servers, HTTP headers sent with every request.":"`http` 서버의 경우 모든 요청과 함께 전송되는 HTTP 헤더입니다.","agentHost.config.mcpServers.headers.title\u0000Headers":"헤더","agentHost.config.mcpServers.title\u0000MCP Servers":"MCP 서버","agentHost.config.mcpServers.type.description\u0000The transport used to reach the server: `stdio` for a local command, `http` for a remote endpoint.":"서버에 도달하는 데 사용되는 전송입니다. 로컬 명령에는 `stdio`, 원격 엔드포인트에는 `http`를 사용합니다.","agentHost.config.mcpServers.type.title\u0000Server Type":"서버 유형","agentHost.config.mcpServers.url.description\u0000For `http` servers, the endpoint URL of the MCP server.":"`http` 서버의 경우 MCP 서버의 엔드포인트 URL입니다.","agentHost.config.mcpServers.url.title\u0000URL":"URL","agentHost.config.migrateLegacyCopilotCliEnabled.description\u0000Whether un-adopted extension-host Copilot CLI sessions are surfaced as adoptable agent-host sessions and migrated in place when opened.":"Whether un-adopted extension-host Copilot CLI sessions are surfaced as adoptable agent-host sessions and migrated in place when opened.","agentHost.config.migrateLegacyCopilotCliEnabled.title\u0000Migrate Legacy Copilot CLI Sessions":"Migrate Legacy Copilot CLI Sessions","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.availableTools.description\u0000When set, only matching tools are available to sessions on this model. Patterns: bare tool names, `builtin:*` or `builtin:<name>` (Copilot runtime tools), `mcp:*` or `mcp:<name>` (MCP server tools), and `custom:*` or `custom:<name>` (every tool VS Code registers with the SDK, including the agent host's own terminal tools); a bare `*` expands to all three sources. Applied when the session launches or resumes.":"When set, only matching tools are available to sessions on this model. Patterns: bare tool names, `builtin:*` or `builtin:<name>` (Copilot runtime tools), `mcp:*` or `mcp:<name>` (MCP server tools), and `custom:*` or `custom:<name>` (every tool VS Code registers with the SDK, including the agent host's own terminal tools); a bare `*` expands to all three sources. Applied when the session launches or resumes.","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.availableTools.item.title\u0000Tool Name or Pattern":"Tool Name or Pattern","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.availableTools.title\u0000Available Tools":"Available Tools","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.description\u0000Per-model overrides for Copilot SDK sessions. Use `*` to match every model. Intended for experimentation.":"Per-model capability overrides for Copilot SDK sessions, keyed by model id (`*` matches every model; a specific entry wins field-by-field). Aliasing a model id to a known `family` routes it to that family's tuned system prompt and tool profile without changing the model id sent to the runtime; the remaining fields override reasoning effort, tool enablement, and model capability limits per model. Only affects Copilot SDK sessions; intended for experimentation.","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.entry.description\u0000A single capability override. The property key is the model id.":"단일 기능 재정의입니다. 속성 키는 모델 ID입니다.","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.entry.title\u0000Capability Override":"기능 재정의","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.excludedTools.description\u0000Tools disabled for sessions on this model; same pattern syntax as `availableTools` and takes precedence over it. Note that `custom:*` and a bare `*` also disable the agent host's own terminal tools registered with the SDK. Applied when the session launches or resumes.":"Tools disabled for sessions on this model; same pattern syntax as `availableTools` and takes precedence over it. Note that `custom:*` and a bare `*` also disable the agent host's own terminal tools registered with the SDK. Applied when the session launches or resumes.","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.excludedTools.item.title\u0000Tool Name or Pattern":"Tool Name or Pattern","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.excludedTools.title\u0000Excluded Tools":"Excluded Tools","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.family.description\u0000Route the model to another family's tuned system prompt and tool profile (e.g. `claude-opus-4.8`). The model id sent to the runtime is unaffected, so the session still runs on the selected model.":"Route the model to another family's tuned system prompt and tool profile (e.g. `claude-opus-4.8`). The model id sent to the runtime is unaffected, so the session still runs on the selected model.","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.family.title\u0000Family":"제품군","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.modelCapabilities.description\u0000Per-property model capability overrides passed through to the Copilot SDK's `modelCapabilities` session field (e.g. `{ \"supports\": { \"vision\": false }, \"limits\": { \"max_context_window_tokens\": 64000 } }`), deep-merged over the runtime's resolved defaults for this model. Applied when the session launches or resumes.":"Per-property model capability overrides passed through to the Copilot SDK's `modelCapabilities` session field (e.g. `{ \"supports\": { \"vision\": false }, \"limits\": { \"max_context_window_tokens\": 64000 } }`), deep-merged over the runtime's resolved defaults for this model. Applied when the session launches or resumes.","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.modelCapabilities.title\u0000Model Capabilities":"Model Capabilities","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.reasoningEffort.description\u0000Reasoning effort for sessions on this model; overrides the model picker's thinking level. Unrecognized values are ignored.":"Reasoning effort for sessions on this model; overrides the model picker's thinking level. Unrecognized values are ignored.","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.reasoningEffort.title\u0000Reasoning Effort":"Reasoning Effort","agentHost.config.modelCapabilityOverrides.title\u0000Model Capability Overrides":"모델 기능 재정의","agentHost.config.multiTurnContextRouting.description\u0000When enabled, Auto model selection sends prior user messages to the router so it scores the conversation so far instead of the latest message alone.":"When enabled, Auto model selection sends prior user messages to the router so it scores the conversation so far instead of the latest message alone.","agentHost.config.multiTurnContextRouting.title\u0000Auto Multi-Turn Context Routing":"Auto Multi-Turn Context Routing","agentHost.config.opus48Prompt.description\u0000When enabled, Copilot SDK sessions running a Claude Opus 4.8 model apply Opus 4.8-tuned system-prompt section overrides on top of the default system message.":"활성화하면 Claude Opus 4.8 모델을 실행하는 Copilot SDK 세션에서 기본 시스템 메시지 위에 Opus 4.8에 맞춘 시스템 프롬프트 섹션 재정의를 적용합니다.","agentHost.config.opus48Prompt.title\u0000Opus 4.8 Agent Prompt":"Opus 4.8 에이전트 프롬프트","agentHost.config.reasoningSummary.description\u0000When enabled, requests concise reasoning summaries for supported Copilot SDK sessions.":"When enabled, requests concise reasoning summaries for supported Copilot SDK sessions.","agentHost.config.reasoningSummary.title\u0000Reasoning Summary":"Reasoning Summary","agentHost.config.rubberDuck.description\u0000When enabled, the coding agent uses a rubber duck critic subagent to review code changes using a 