ile file and folder references include their path.":"To inspect an inline attachment reference, place the cursor on it and invoke Show or Focus Hover{0}. Image references include a preview, while file and folder references include their path.","chat.attachments.inlineReferences\u0000To mention an attached context item at a specific position without removing it from the attached context, type # or @ and select the attachment from the suggestions.":"To mention an attached context item at a specific position without removing it from the attached context, type # or @ and select the attachment from the suggestions.","chat.attachments.pastedText\u0000Long pasted text is stored as an attached text item and replaced in the input with a numbered inline reference.":"Long pasted text is stored as an attached text item and replaced in the input with a numbered inline reference.","chat.attachments.removal\u0000To remove attached contexts, focus an attachment and press Delete or Backspace.":"첨부된 컨텍스트를 제거하려면 첨부 파일에 포커스를 두고 Delete 또는 Backspace를 누릅니다.","chat.autoImageAttachment\u0000Attached image, {0}. Image support depends on the model selected by Auto.":"첨부 이미지, {0}. 이미지 지원은 Auto에서 선택한 모델에 따라 달라집니다.","chat.autoImageAttachmentHover\u0000Image support depends on the model selected by Auto.":"이미지 지원은 Auto에서 선택한 모델에 따라 달라집니다.","chat.autoReply.description\u0000Automatically skip question carousels by telling the agent that the user is not available and to use its best judgment. This is an advanced setting and can lead to unintended choices or actions based on incomplete context.":"사용자가 사용할 수 없다고 에이전트에 알리고 최선의 판단으로 질문 캐러셀을 자동으로 건너뛰게 합니다. 이 설정은 고급 설정이며 불완전한 컨텍스트에 따라 의도하지 않은 선택 또는 작업으로 이어질 수 있습니다.","chat.autoapprove.lmServicePerTool.profile\u0000Auto approved for this profile":"이 프로필에 대해 자동 승인됨","chat.autoapprove.lmServicePerTool.session\u0000Auto approved for this session":"이 세션에 대해 자동 승인됨","chat.autoapprove.lmServicePerTool.workspace\u0000Auto approved for this workspace":"이 작업 영역에 대해 