re permitted; any other server is blocked. Servers can be matched by name, remote URL pattern (with `*` wildcards), or local command invocation. Omit entirely to allow all servers (subject to the deny list). Delivered via enterprise policy for governance; this setting is not surfaced to end users.":"Enterprise-managed allowlist that controls which Model Context Protocol servers may be installed and run. When set, only servers matching an entry are permitted; any other server is blocked. Servers can be matched by name, remote URL pattern (with `*` wildcards), or local command invocation. Omit entirely to allow all servers (subject to the deny list). Delivered via enterprise policy for governance; this setting is not surfaced to end users.","chat.mcp.allowedServers.policy\u0000Allowlist of Model Context Protocol servers. When set, only servers matching an entry may be installed or run; omit entirely to allow all servers (subject to the deny list).":"Allowlist of Model Context Protocol servers. When set, only servers matching an entry may be installed or run; omit entirely to allow all servers (subject to the deny list).","chat.mcp.allowedServers.serverCommand\u0000Match a local server by its exact command invocation, given as the command followed by its arguments.":"Match a local server by its exact command invocation, given as the command followed by its arguments.","chat.mcp.allowedServers.serverName\u0000Match a server by its configured name.":"Match a server by its configured name.","chat.mcp.allowedServers.serverUrl\u0000Match a remote server by its URL. Supports `*` wildcards, for example `https://*.example.com/*`.":"Match a remote server by its URL. Supports `*` wildcards, for example `https://*.example.com/*`.","chat.mcp.assisted.nuget.enabled.description\u0000Enables NuGet packages for AI-assisted MCP server installation. Used to install MCP servers by name from the central registry for .NET packages (NuGet.org).":"AI 지원 MCP 서버 설치를 위해 NuGet 패키지를 사용하도록 설정합니다. 